<aside class="sim-notice" aria-label="About this project">
  <h2>A portfolio simulation, not the official game</h2>
  <p>
    The Pokémon Trading Card Game is a real game with official digital versions. This app isn't one of them.
    It is a small simulation I built to show how the rules can be modelled in Ruby on Rails, and it doesn't replace
    or compete with the real thing. Card data is used only as facts, and card artwork and official card text are left out.
    To play the real game, visit <a href="https://tcg.pokemon.com/en-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tcg.pokemon.com</a>.
  </p>
</aside>
